flowchart LR
  U[Publisher / Wallet] -->|task + budget + 6% fee| CF[Cloudflare Edge]
  CF -->|signed command| AWS[AWS private control plane]
  AWS -->|task/node metadata| LG[LangGraph workflow state]
  LG -->|category + tags + hard gates| M[Matcher + score window]
  M -->|4 distinct candidates -> 3| A[Local / Provider Agents]
  A -->|node input/output only| X[AWS node exchange boundary]
  X -->|HMAC + replay + PII gates| LG
  LG -->|taskId + workflowId + dagHash + nodeId| S[Sepolia V3 contracts]
  S -->|stake receipt + ruling state| U
  AWS -->|sanitized OfficeSnapshotV2| O[Cocos office presentation]
  O -->|select-desk event only| U

  subgraph Private_Data[Private AWS data]
    AWS
    LG
    M
    X
  end

  subgraph Public_Chain[Public chain authority]
    S
  end

  subgraph Presentation[Presentation only]
    O
  end
